###### Correct answer: score becomes 1
##@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/quiz-backend
###POST {{baseUrl}}/api/answers
###Content-Type: application/json
###
###{
###  "questionId": 1,
###  "selectedChoiceIndex": 0
###}
###
###### Incorrect answer: score remains 1
###POST {{baseUrl}}/api/answers
###Content-Type: application/json
###
###{
###  "questionId": 1,
###  "selectedChoiceIndex": 1
###}
###
###### Correct answer: score becomes 2
###POST {{baseUrl}}/api/answers
###Content-Type: application/json
###
###{
###  "questionId": 2,
###  "selectedChoiceIndex": 1
###}
###
###### Restart the quiz
###POST {{baseUrl}}/api/quiz/restart
###Accept: application/json
###
###### Unknown question ID
###POST {{baseUrl}}/api/answers
###Content-Type: application/json
###Accept: application/json
###
###{
###  "questionId": 999,
###  "selectedChoiceIndex": 0
###}
###
###
